{"server":"cn","storyId":"act23side_level_act23side_04_beg","groupId":"act23side","stageId":"act23side_04","title":"不念往昔","storyCode":"WB-4","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act23side/level_act23side_04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"288b79fe2d296af0f1367e8eb969d33e565e8a8702cbfc3bf86ec72128c416a0","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g2_yumenstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孟叔，孟叔，你在里面吗？我有话要问你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是杜遥夜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"附近的游侠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘，别敲了，没看见门口挂的牌子啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"附近的游侠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"晚饭时候门就关了，你有啥事明天再来吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"附近的游侠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，怎么还不理人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孟叔！你是不是有事瞒着我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再不答应，我就自己进去了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"附近的游侠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"又来一个......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"附近的游侠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"现在的年轻人怎么都大半夜往铁匠铺跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？行裕客栈郑掌柜的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是之前找过爹的那个年轻官差？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杜小姐何时来的玉门？此刻出现在这里又所为何事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又是来干嘛的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"查案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"官府查到铸剑坊，难道孟叔他真的做了什么事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听杜小姐的语气，这里果真有问题......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我在问你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倘若杜小姐和此事无关，还请不要耽误在下查案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁在耽误谁......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"刀光硬生生截断了杜遥夜的话头。\n门锁落下，“暂停营业”的牌子碎成两半，左乐已经冲进了铸剑坊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"附近的游侠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（孟大哥只是让我盯着些，想不到真有人来闹事。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"附近的游侠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（不行，得去叫人来帮忙。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g5_swordcastingworkshop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你干什么！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟你说话呢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打你怎么了！官差就是这么查案的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g11_yanroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"进。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鲤先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚看到槐琥跑了出去，风风火火的，我喊她都没答应。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟才刚大学毕业，正是一腔热血的年纪，难免头脑简单，雨霞姑娘多教教她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鲤先生的员工，哪儿轮得到我来指手画脚。是我给她添麻烦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪儿的话。年轻人嘛，多长长见识，也是好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凭那孩子的身手，就算遇到几个坏人，也用不着担心就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天晚上，爸他找过鲤先生，是有事情找您帮忙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也谈不上帮忙......只是在找人的时候顺便听到了一些故事，侦探的耳朵总是灵一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是能对雨霞姑娘查案有帮助，那就再好不过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鲤先生请坐，讲故事总不能站着。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我想想该从何说起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打个比方，如果魏彦吾和令尊不合，那龙门会变成什么样子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"“天灾当前，城里又有山海众作乱，将军亲自带兵镇守城门，哪有工夫见一个百姓？”\n“我听说这个人以前和将军认识。”\n“还是通报一下吧，万一他真有什么事呢？”\n......\n“你上去吧，将军同意见你。”\n“他就在城楼上。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"夜已经很深了。\n军用源石射灯嵌进城墙，随台阶一路上铺，周围明亮得像是白昼。\n但孟铁衣走得很慢，身后的军士也没有催他。\n他已经十多年没有登上玉门的城楼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"见过平祟侯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你就直接说明来意吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望平祟侯能批准我出城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信使队伍出了事，听说尸骨都没剩下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队伍里有铸剑坊的几位兄弟，总得有人去接他们。起码也该在他们身死的地方，洒一坛酒，捧几抔沙回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将军。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"封城的命令，是否已经下达到了全城？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你听到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我才来找平祟侯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"绝无可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位师傅，玉门正在高速移动，一日几十里，外面是茫茫戈壁，现在就算放你出城也没有用......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，玉门已经走得太远了，沙漠风大，兄弟们要怎么找回来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"逝者已矣，但玉门前行，不容耽搁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杀害信使团队的贼寇已潜入城中，现在全城戒严，早日将他们一网打尽，也能告慰亡者的在天之灵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，还请平祟侯恩准我们一起追查凶手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这阵子城里人员混杂，我们这些跑江湖的，总能帮得上忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"捉拿凶手，护卫玉门，玉门军人职责所在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果还要劳烦百姓，是左某无能了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你来找我，就为了此事？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g8_yumenarena"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"于空中出剑，力道凌厉无匹，竟然能强行收住劲头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羽兽凌江，衔鳞而起，水面只留下涟漪点点。师姐发劲收劲，又到了新的境界。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"师姐可否再演示一遍？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除非你能让刚刚那只受惊的小沙地兽再蹿出来一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......倒是不能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所谓招式，不过是把人的反应抽象归整，方便理解。人的反应哪里有定数，武功的精妙都在临场的变化里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你记录天下武学，别老跟一招一式过不去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“形”是躯壳，“意”是精神，老师很早就教导过我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人哪，有些事情明明知道，但总是改不掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也是太呆了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像是千夫长在集结军队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"足足一个百人队，好大的阵仗......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g8_yumenarena"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"千夫长，队伍已经集结完毕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫长","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"清点装备，跟我前往城南铸剑坊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫长","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来是仇姑娘和录武官小哥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"千夫长现在整兵，难道是发现了山海众的行踪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫长","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太合御史在铸剑坊附近被人重伤，左乐公子命我带兵清查铸剑坊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行动通报了平祟侯没有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫长","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将军现在镇守外城楼，昨天已经授权给公子，三日内可以调度他的亲兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有直接证据证明是铸剑坊干的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫长","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"具体的还不清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左乐人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫长","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公子已经先一步过去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫长","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太合御史受伤，他很着急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g5_swordcastingworkshop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关门闭户，歹人聚集，好个铸剑坊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴险的山海众成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人不在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴险的山海众成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"居然和秉烛人暗中往来，姓孟的果然不可信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天灾数据还在姓孟的身上，去把他找出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先解决对面这两个娃娃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们到底是什么人？孟叔呢？他是遭了你们的毒手，还是和你们一伙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大小齐又在哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不说话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就打到你们说话为止......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"刀光从杜遥夜身旁掠过，左乐踏步向前。\n他一言不发，刀挥得很快，眉头皱得很紧。\n这是杜遥夜今天第二次被截断话头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"混账——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴险的山海众成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么人！"},{"type":"narration","text":"这里不能被毁掉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们住手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"院子里的东西都被打坏了，要打出去打！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴险的山海众成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"居然还藏着帮手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘶——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这把剑怎么会在她身上......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴险的山海众成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"头儿，这女娃身上有伤！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先解决她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"像是突然起了一阵风，满院的细沙被搅起，人影交错。\n受伤的异族少女捂着伤口后退，靠在老槐树上用力喘息。她没有注意到杜遥夜的靠近。\n蒙面的凶徒再次隐入屋檐边的阴影。\n年轻的秉烛人走到庭院中间，将两个少女挡在身后。他的腰间不知何时多出来一把剑，被暗扣牢牢锁住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的剑！"},{"type":"narration","text":"肩上什么时候空的？刚刚的冲击......\n一截断裂的皮料落在地上。那是族人用猎到的动物毛皮制成的束带，坚韧耐磨，用来绑剑再合适不过。\n绑那柄她一刻也不曾离身的剑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是宗师的佩剑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你与山海众并无勾结，剑现在在我手里，权且算你物归原主。擅闯军营的罪责，之后再追究。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还给我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是谁？你不要拉我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的伤不轻，我警告你不要乱动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不管那把剑什么情况。但你既然早就藏在铸剑坊里，说明你认识孟铁衣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还请告诉我，他现在去了哪里？你有没有在铸剑坊里看见两个尚蜀年轻人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是不说，我会在你的伤口上再补一拳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴险的山海众成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来这几个家伙并不是一起的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴险的山海众成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面的人，封好出口，别让他们有路跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴险的山海众成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听到没有？回话！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"声音近在咫尺。他慌忙回头。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"疼痛随着自己的移动而越发清晰，清晰得就像那个断成两截的通讯工具。\n他没来得及后悔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"仇姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面的已经解决了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和先前在集市袭击你的是同一拨人。山海众？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鲁莽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不止是武艺没有长进......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等拿了这伙人，我再听仇姐姐教训！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等。"},{"type":"narration","text":"刚才还没察觉，只是出了几剑，手心竟然已经生汗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这间院子......这个温度......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像越来越热了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今只到三月份，也还没看见太阳，气温怎么反而在升高？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道是铸剑坊的源石锻造炉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炉火早就熄了 。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"气愤的山海众成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"头儿，她伤了我们好几个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别再浪费时间了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们还知道浪费了时间。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"三月中，这个时节会有蝉鸣吗？\n空气中的湿意沉沉地压下来，黏腻透衣，这绝不是早春的露。\n在场所有人都感受到了异样。\n一滴水落在仇白的脸上。\n北地春来迟，老槐还来不及长出新叶——\n这是刀刃凝出的水珠！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众首领","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孟铁衣呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不在铸剑坊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们正准备离开，就遇上了这几个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这把刀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是你伤了太合叔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
